# Milo Julo runs on Cloudflare Workers. Configuration is stored as Worker secrets, not in a .env file:
#   cd worker && npx wrangler secret put NAME
#
# Required
#   JWT_SECRET               48+ random characters  (openssl rand -base64 48)
#   ADMIN_EMAILS             your email; signing up with it makes you the admin
# Payments (Razorpay dashboard → Account & Settings → API Keys / Webhooks)
#   RAZORPAY_KEY_ID, RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET, RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET
# Email (resend.com) for password resets
#   RESEND_API_KEY           and set EMAIL_FROM in worker/wrangler.toml
# Calls on mobile data (Cloudflare dashboard → Realtime → TURN Server → Create)
#   TURN_KEY_ID, TURN_KEY_API_TOKEN
# Android app (optional)
#   ANDROID_SHA256_FINGERPRINT
#
# Local development uses worker/.dev.vars (git-ignored).
